Z||000000||Chris McDonald||01-01-2001||11:26 AM||||This is an actual photo of the front of a G.M. engine block.  Neither the photo or block have been modified.  The letters/words you see are actual "HIPER ASS".  <P>Can anybody identify this block?<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/ViewPhoto?u=1428880&a=10703563&p=36743812" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/ViewPhoto?u=1428880&a=10703563&p=36743812</A> <P><BR>Disclaimer:  If you can't view the image, blame it on me.  I am not sure how to follow the photo attachment directions.<P><BR>Chris<P>||||reg||5
