Z||000013||Chris McDonald||01-01-2001||08:17 PM||||The "Boat" may be a very good guess.  The water jackets are rather rusty and there is significant pitting on the top of the block from the water jackets on the heads.<P>The truth is, I don't know what it came out of.  What I do know is it is a Chevrolet 454 with a forged crank.  I did a little horse trading with a fellow and ended up with it last week.  Right now I am trying to figure out what I am going to do with it.  I think the "ASS" was a factory typo.  Looks like it should have said "PASS" like it is stamped on the side of the block.  <P><BR>If I can sell two high performance small blocks I have laying around (one came out of a V8 Fiero), I might have enough $$$$$ to do something with it.||||reg||1
